@page "/docs/trust-api"
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<PageTitle>White-label Trust API — CrowdFund AI</PageTitle>

<div class="page-container py-5" style="max-width:900px;">
    <h1 class="fw-bold mb-1">White-label Trust API</h1>
    <p class="text-muted mb-4">
        Let other fundraising platforms plug into CrowdFund AI’s verification layer under their own brand.
        Trust scores remain <strong>advisory</strong> — not a guarantee of legitimacy.
    </p>

    <div class="cf-card mb-3">
        <h5>1. Auth</h5>
        <pre class="small mb-0">POST /api/oauth/token
{ "client_id": "...", "client_secret": "...", "grant_type": "client_credentials" }

→ Authorization: Bearer {access_token}</pre>
        <p class="small text-muted mt-2 mb-0">Admin creates partners at <code>POST /api/admin/partners</code> (scopes include <code>trust:write</code>). Bind <code>TenantId</code> for hard isolation + branding.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cf-card mb-3">
        <h5>2. Register a campaign (external ref)</h5>
        <pre class="small mb-0">POST /api/trust/v1/campaigns
{
  "title": "Relief fund",
  "story": "...",
  "category": "Disaster Relief",
  "goalAmount": 10000,
  "externalRef": "their-platform-campaign-99",
  "platformName": "OtherFund"
}</pre>
    </div>

    <div class="cf-card mb-3">
        <h5>3. Upload documents &amp; evaluate</h5>
        <pre class="small mb-0">POST /api/trust/v1/campaigns/{id}/documents  (multipart: file, docType)
POST /api/trust/v1/campaigns/{id}/evaluate

→ trustScore, band, findings, flags, badge URLs</pre>
    </div>

    <div class="cf-card mb-3">
        <h5>4. Embed badge (branded by tenant)</h5>
        <pre class="small mb-0">GET /api/trust/v1/campaigns/{id}/badge.svg
GET /api/trust/v1/campaigns/{id}/badge.json</pre>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Colors and label come from the partner’s Tenant white-label settings.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cf-card mb-3">
        <h5>5. Webhooks</h5>
        <pre class="small mb-0">POST /api/trust/v1/webhooks
{ "url": "https://their.app/hooks/trust", "eventType": "trust.updated" }</pre>
    </div>

    <p class="small text-muted">Discovery: <code>GET /api/trust/v1/health</code> · <code>GET /api/trust/v1/openapi-lite</code></p>
</div>
